\textbf{Solution:} Since $\angle AOC : \angle BOC = 1 : 2$ and $\angle AOB = 120^\circ$,

thus $\angle AOC = \frac{1}{3} \angle AOB = \frac{1}{3} \times 120^\circ = \boxed{40^\circ}$,

and $\angle BOC = \frac{2}{3} \angle AOB = \frac{2}{3} \times 120^\circ = \boxed{80^\circ}$;
